{"version":1,"content":"<p>Epic Games宣佈舉辦2026年Epic AI MegaJam遊戲開發競賽，參賽者將在11月12日至15日的四天內，使用虛幻引擎（Unreal Engine）或《堡壘之夜》虛幻編輯器（UEFN）製作一款可遊玩的遊戲。活動面向全球線上開放，也將在三藩市Digital Jungle場地舉辦線下環節，比賽主題預計於11月11日直播公佈。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/game/1583496.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T06:23:57.485091+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":174,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T05:51:29+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T06:18:08.951755+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T06:18:08.951755+00:00","content_hash":"6f854245d6e7b9549643450d0d95b29072973fce008e0904526c917826f6f140","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}